+// worth; ρ makes it 0 from here, so it prices only where a job leaves us. W_h is the loop's worth
+// without home weight, stickiness or carry; c_h the capture and our fastest clear. The term falls
+// with r ≥ c_h, so Δ, its most at r = c_h, bounds every δ: each prune adds Δ's rate over its rounds.
